386→                        <div id="content">Suppose $A\subseteq \mathbb{N}$ is a Sidon set. How large can\[\limsup_{N\to \infty}\frac{\lvert A\cap \{1,\ldots,N\}\rvert}{N^{1/2}}\]be?</div>
387→                        <div id="problem_id"><a href="/329">#329</a>: <a href="#cite-Er77c-329" onclick="event.preventDefault();addNewBox('Er77c','329'); return false;">[Er77c]</a><a href="#cite-ErGr80-329" onclick="event.preventDefault();addNewBox('ErGr80','329'); return false;">[ErGr80,p.49]</a><a href="#cite-Er85c-329" onclick="event.preventDefault();addNewBox('Er85c','329'); return false;">[Er85c,p.77]</a></div>
